<h1>Multiple Represenations</h1>

<p>This test case illustrates that transformations are associated
with <em>representations</em> of information resources.</p>

<p>This <a href="multipleRepresentations.html">HTML page</a> is an HTML
represenation of a <a href="multipleRepresentation">information resource</a>.
There is also an <a href="multipleRepresenations.svg">SVG represenation</a>
of that information resource.  Transforms associated with the HTML
representation should not be run on the svg representation unless they
are specifically indicated to apply to that representation as well.</p>

